flowchart TD
    Client["前端客户端"] -->|登录请求| LoginController["登录控制器(LoginController)"]
    LoginController -->|验证凭据| LoginUseCase["登录用例(LoginUseCase)"]
    LoginUseCase -->|生成令牌| JwtService["JWT服务"]
    JwtService -->|返回令牌| LoginController
    LoginController -->|返回响应| Client
    Client -->|携带令牌请求| APIGateway["API网关"]
    APIGateway -->|验证令牌| JwtFilter["JWT过滤器"]
    JwtFilter -->|授权检查| AuthorizationService["授权服务"]
    JwtFilter -->|有效令牌| RouteRequest["路由请求"]
    JwtFilter -->|无效令牌| ReturnError["返回错误响应"]
    RouteRequest -->|转发请求| ProtectedController["受保护控制器"]
    ProtectedController -->|返回响应| Client
    Client -->|刷新令牌| RefreshTokenController["刷新令牌控制器"]
    RefreshTokenController -->|验证刷新令牌| RefreshTokenUseCase["刷新令牌用例"]
    RefreshTokenUseCase -->|生成新令牌| JwtService
    JwtService -->|返回新令牌| RefreshTokenController
    RefreshTokenController -->|返回响应| Client

    subgraph 认证层
        LoginController
        LoginUseCase
        JwtService
        RefreshTokenController
        RefreshTokenUseCase
    end

    subgraph 授权层
        APIGateway
        JwtFilter
        AuthorizationService
    end
